<title>JAPAN: Copal - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Copal - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 21.03		vs	   21.53</p>
<p> Operating   loss 873    million    vs	prft 113 million</p>
<p> Current	 loss 1.30		vs	 prft 57 million</p>
<p> Net	     loss 1.26		vs	  prft 2 million</p>
<p> EPS	    loss 23.13 yen	  vs     prft 0.04 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     54 million	  vs	  54 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Copal Co Ltd is a maker of camera shutters.</p>
</text>
